title: "AbdomenAtlas: a large-scale, detailed-annotated, multi-center abdominal CT dataset"
abstract: "Toolkit and documentation for AbdomenAtlas, a large-scale multi-center abdominal CT dataset with per-voxel annotation of abdominal organs, built for transfer learning and open algorithmic benchmarking."
